          <text x="625" y="26" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="17" fontWeight="900" fill={NAVY} fontFamily="Arial" letterSpacing="0.5">ŞİMŞEK HABERLEŞME — TT Wireless Project Organization Chart</text>
